This is my
girlfriend. Elyse.

47
00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:16.577
Hey. what's going on?

48
00:06:16.644 --> 00:06:17.444
Nice to meet you.

49
00:06:17.511 --> 00:06:18.613
Nice to meet you. I'm Andy.

50
00:06:18.679 --> 00:06:21.849
Yeah. Andy and I.
we were in a band together

51
00:06:21.916 --> 00:06:23.517
