due to toxic mold.

255
00:18:12.092 --> 00:18:13.460
<i>Oh. fuck.</i>

256
00:18:13.528 --> 00:18:16.396
These mobbed-up construction
guys might make me disappear.

257
00:18:16.463 --> 00:18:20.768
<i>Maybe you could</i>
<i>leverage your findings</i>

